.mf
# bun.lockb is committed (as an EMPTY file) ONLY so Cloudflare Pages'
# automatic package-manager detection picks Bun — its detector only
# recognizes the legacy binary lockfile name, not bun.lock. The real
# lockfile is bun.lock, which Bun v1.2+ prioritizes over bun.lockb.
# Do not remove it without an alternative that makes CF use Bun.
#bun.lockb

